l para promover estímulos adequados ao desenvolvimento facial.A avaliação precoce é fundamental, muitas vezes iniciada ainda na dentição de leite para prevenir problemas severos na vida adulta. Dra Lina Alencar clínica odontológica SorrisokidsFamily em Juazeiro do Norte Ceará"}, "cta_type": "WHATSAPP_MESSAGE", "display_format": "VIDEO", "link_description": null, "link_url": "https://api.whatsapp.com/send", "images": [], "page_categories": ["Dentist"], "page_like_count": 892, "title": null, "videos": [{"video_hd_url": "https://video.ftls1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQO_jEdLT7pgh15BZ2yslz7k9zWBnz6fGmmTHhBAOW2f1RDEBlBVQcjrI5fKZpgTu7BH0QsbtOubij1uSPcm-Zzh-H9z8o-tnNYMm4_OWQ.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Adp1C6e-ZMJ1Yh-tXJrVZUh1LJf8Oa8IKHVHlA--9A4u0BbB0WWyYRE3inPjRXWoJBs&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video.ftls1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=HLn0UA692YEQ7kNvwEZ430k&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLnByb2dyZXNzaXZlX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl83MjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjoyMTc5NDQ4Nzg5NTUyNTIyLCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6OTMsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo1OSwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=IM4fHwqLISKaG6KX39mH-g&_nc_ss=7f289&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQEuNm4WenYTXHD9ny4cUke13ifqXld0ruZH3JAZ8P4USg&oe=6A83CFB6", "video_preview_image_url": "https://scontent.ftls1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/707812600_2019422355603601_4989398843691095139_n.jpg?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=fiOTdNxn4D4Q7kNvwHNKX_i&_nc_oc=AdpMOLpPPYeFBNn3s2wGvo0qRNdz6CdCt3nZEPJr4u83Fk2LQVfsx-CDFzC2cNUWC5s&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.ftls1-1.fna&_nc_gid=IM4fHwqLISKaG6KX39mH-g&_nc_ss=7f289&oh=00_AQFbiMqObHnps0ybw9xs1bmmU5ih7eLlkt2yLQWSH-gsBw&oe=6A83D7A5", "video_sd_url": "https://video.ftls1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQMAVM13LEPKvhwOZ_e0EZuf7-mNSdnSWDx_Uy87aB7MPj40jzQhK8bh0i-1mJWwrTZcRoxlBeE5oQ5wvFfb20wtNshnVTn14M37gwSgTA.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdpxUFXvtvz1R7E05yoamejd7fKGTsE5Mm5p4Phuy_3ZpymhfKV7gLVCHcY3n-L8ThA&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video.ftls1-1.f